s dans la documentation","Décompte de fichiers dans la documentation","Intégration avec Claude Code workflow engine","Compatibilité avec TDD automation et GPT delegation","Prise en charge de l''ingénierie de contexte"],"de":["Überprüfung der Zeilenlimits in der Dokumentation","Überprüfung der Querreferenzen in der Dokumentation","Zählung von Dateien in der Dokumentation","Integration mit Claude Code workflow engine","Kompatibilität mit TDD-Automatisierung und GPT-Delegation","Unterstützung für die Kontextingenieurie"],"pt":["Verificação de limites de linhas","Verificação de referências cruzadas","Contagem de arquivos","Integração com o Claude Code workflow engine","Suporte à automação de testes com TDD","Delegação de tarefas ao GPT"],"ru":["Проверка ограничений строк","Проверка кросс-референсов","Подсчет файлов","Интеграция с Claude Code workflow engine","Поддержка автоматизации тестирования с TDD","Делегирование задач GPT"],"ar":["التحقق من حدود الأسطر","التحقق من المراجع المتقاطعة","عداد الملفات","التكامل مع Claude Code workflow engine","دعم التلقائية في الاختبار مع TDD","تفويض المهام إلى GPT"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use docs-verify","docs-verify setup guide","what is docs-verify","docs-verify alternative","docs-verify vs Claude Code","automated documentation validation","SPEC-first planning","TDD automation","GPT delegation","context engineering"],"zh":["docs-verify","文档验证","SPEC-first","TDD","GPT","AIエージェント","文档系统","验证技能"],"ja":["docs-verify","ドキュメント検証","SPEC-first","TDD","GPT","AIエージェント","ドキュメントシステム","検証スキル"],"ko":["docs-verify","문서 검증","SPEC-first","TDD","GPT","AI 에이전트","문서 시스템","검증 스킬"],"es":["docs-verify","verificación de documentación","herramientas de documentación","Claude Code workflow engine","TDD automation","GPT delegation","ingeniería de contexto","diseño de documentación","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["docs-verify","vérification de documentation","outils de documentation","Claude Code workflow engine","TDD automation","GPT delegation","ingénierie de contexte","conception de documentation","développement de logiciels"],"de":["docs-verify","Dokumentenverifizierung","Dokumentenwerkzeuge","Claude Code workflow engine","TDD-Automatisierung","GPT-Delegation","Kontextingenieurie","Dokumentendesign","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["docs-verify","verificação de documentação","automatização de testes","TDD","GPT","Claude Code workflow engine","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software","testes automatizados"],"ru":["docs-verify","верификация документации","автоматизация тестирования","TDD","GPT","Claude Code workflow engine","инструменты разработки","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизированное тестирование"],"ar":["docs-verify","التحقق من المستندات","التلقائية في الاختبار","TDD","GPT","Claude Code workflow engine","أدوات التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات","الاختبار التلقائي"]}},"owner":"changoo89","repo":"claude-pilot","repoPath":"changoo89/claude-pilot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.311Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docs-verify","description":"Documentation verification for 3-Tier system - validates line limits, cross-references, file counts","bodyPreview":"# SKILL: Documentation Verification\n\n> **Purpose**: Validate 3-Tier documentation system compliance - line limits, cross-references, file counts\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### When to Use\n\n- After closing plan (`/03_close`)\n- After running `/document`\n- Before committing documentation changes\n\n### Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Pure bash link check (no external deps)\nfor file in CLAUDE.md docs/ai-context/*.md; do\n  [ -f \"$file\" ] || continue\n  grep -oE ''@[^][:space:]]+'' \"$file\" | while read ref; do\n    r","body":"# SKILL: Documentation Verification\n\n> **Purpose**: Validate 3-Tier documentation system compliance - line limits, cross-references, file counts\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### When to Use\n\n- After closing plan (`/03_close`)\n- After running `/document`\n- Before committing documentation changes\n\n### Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Pure bash link check (no external deps)\nfor file in CLAUDE.md docs/ai-context/*.md; do\n  [ -f \"$file\" ] || continue\n  grep -oE ''@[^][:space:]]+'' \"$file\" | while read ref; do\n    ref_path=\"${ref#@}\"\n    [ ! -e \"$ref_path\" ] && echo \"Broken: $ref in $file\"\n  done\ndone\n```\n\n---\n\n## Change Detection (MANDATORY FIRST STEP)\n\n**Before running verification, check if docs changed**:\n\n```bash\n# Get changed markdown files (with fallback)\nCHANGED_MD=$(git diff --name-only HEAD~1 -- \"*.md\" 2>/dev/null || git diff --name-only -- \"*.md\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"FALLBACK_FULL_VERIFY\")\n\n# Fallback: If git diff fails, run full verification\nif [ \"$CHANGED_MD\" = \"FALLBACK_FULL_VERIFY\" ]; then\n    echo \"Cannot detect changes, running full verification\"\n    CHANGED_MD=$(find . -name \"*.md\" -type f ! -path \"*/.git/*\" ! -path \"*/.trash/*\")\nfi\n\nif [ -z \"$CHANGED_MD\" ]; then\n    echo \"No markdown files changed\"\n    echo \"Skipping documentation verification\"\n    exit 0\nfi\n\necho \"Changed markdown files:\"\necho \"$CHANGED_MD\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 3-Tier System\n\n**Tier 1** (3 files, ≤200 lines each):\n- `CLAUDE.md` - Project architecture, features, Quick Start\n- `docs/ai-context/project-structure.md` - Tech stack, file tree\n- `docs/ai-context/docs-overview.md` - Documentation navigation\n\n**Tier 2**: Component CONTEXT.md files (unlimited)\n\n**Tier 3**: Feature-specific CONTEXT.md files\n\n---\n\n## Verification Checks\n\n### 1. Tier 1 Line Limits (Changed Files Only)\n\n**Limit**: ≤200 lines per file\n\n```bash\nTIER1_FILES=(\n  \"CLAUDE.md\"\n  \"docs/ai-context/project-structure.md\"\n  \"docs/ai-context/docs-overview.md\"\n)\n\nfor file in \"${TIER1_FILES[@]}\"; do\n  # Only check if file was changed\n  if echo \"$CHANGED_MD\" | grep -q \"$file\"; then\n    LINES=$(wc -l < \"$file\" | tr -d '' '')\n    if [ \"$LINES\" -gt 200 ]; then\n      echo \"FAIL: $file has $LINES lines (limit: 200)\"\n      exit 1\n    fi\n    echo \"$file: $LINES lines\"\n  fi\ndone\n```\n\n**On violation**: Extract content to Tier 2 CONTEXT.md files\n\n### 2. Tier 1 File Count (CRITICAL)\n\n**Limit**: Exactly 2 files in `docs/ai-context/`\n\n```bash\nCOUNT=$(find docs/ai-context -maxdepth 1 -name \"*.md\" -type f | wc -l | tr -d '' '')\nif [ \"$COUNT\" -ne 2 ]; then\n  echo \"FAIL: docs/ai-context/ has $COUNT files (expected: 2)\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n### 3. Cross-Reference Validation (Changed Files Only)\n\n```bash\n# Only validate changed files\nfor file in $CHANGED_MD; do\n  [ -f \"$file\" ] || continue\n  grep -oE ''@\\.(claude|docs)/[^][:space:]]+'' \"$file\" 2>/dev/null | while read ref; do\n    ref_path=\"${ref#@}\"\n    ref_path=\"${ref_path%[\\`\\*\\]\\\"]}\"\n    if [ ! -e \"$ref_path\" ]; then\n      echo \"Broken reference: $ref in $file\"\n    fi\n  done\ndone\n```\n\n### 4. Circular Reference Detection\n\n```bash\n# Check for self-references (A → A)\nfind . -name \"*.md\" ! -path \"*/REFERENCE.md\" ! -path \"*/.git/*\" | while read file; do\n  refs=$(grep -oE ''@\\.(claude|docs)/[^)[:space:]+'' \"$file\" || true)\n  for ref in $refs; do\n    if [ \"${ref#@}\" = \"$file\" ]; then\n      echo \"Self-reference: $file\"\n    fi\n  done\ndone\n```\n\n### 5. Skill Count Validation\n\n```bash\nACTUAL=$(find .claude/skills -name \"SKILL.md\" | wc -l | tr -d '' '')\nSTATED=$(grep -oE ''\\*\\*[0-9]+ Skills\\*\\*'' README.md | grep -oE ''[0-9]+'' || echo \"0\")\n\nif [ \"$ACTUAL\" -ne \"$STATED\" ]; then\n  echo \"WARNING: Skill count mismatch - README: $STATED, actual: $ACTUAL\"\nfi\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration Pattern\n\n### In Commands\n\n```markdown\n## Step 3: Documentation Verification\n\nInvoke the `docs-verify` skill to validate documentation compliance.\n\nThe skill checks:\n- Tier 1 line limits (≤200 lines)\n- Tier 1 file count (exactly 2 in ai-context/)\n- Cross-reference validity\n- Circular references\n```\n\nClaude reads this skill file and executes the bash commands inline.\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n**three-tier-docs**: Full 3-Tier documentation system | **vibe-coding**: File size standards\n\n---\n\n**Version**: claude-pilot 4.4.14\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:33.193Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Developer Agents requiring automated documentation validation and compliance checking","zh":"适用于需要自动化文档验证和合规性检查的开发人员代理","ja":"自動化ドキュメントの検証とコンプライアンスのチェックが必要な開発者エージェントに適しています","ko":"자동화된 문서 검증 및 준수 확인이 필요한 개발자 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollador que requieren validación y comprobación de cumplimiento de documentación automatizada","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une validation et un contrôle de conformité de la documentation automatisés","de":"Ideal für Entwickler-Agenten, die eine automatisierte Überprüfung und Konformitätsprüfung von Dokumentationen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que exigem validação automática de documentação e verificação de conformidade","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, требующих автоматической проверки документации и соблюдения требований","ar":"مثالي لعميل المطور الذي يتطلب التحقق التلقائي من توثيق ومراجعة الامتثال"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate documentation validation, ensuring compliance with line limits, cross-references, and file counts using bash scripts and grep commands, streamlining the documentation process for 3-Tier documentation systems","zh":"赋予代理自动化文档验证的能力，确保文档符合行限制、交叉引用和文件数量要求，使用bash脚本和grep命令，简化三层文档系统的文档过程","ja":"エージェントに自動化ドキュメントの検証を可能にし、行数制限、クロスリファレンス、ファイル数などのコンプライアンスをbashスクリプトとgrepコマンドを使用して確保し、三層ドキュメントシステムのドキュメントプロセスを簡素化する","ko":"에이전트가 문서를 자동으로 검증할 수 있도록 하여, 행 제한, 교차 참조, 파일 수 등의 요구사항을 준수하도록 bash 스크립트와 grep 명령어를 사용하여 문서화를 단순화하는 3계층 문서 시스템","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la validación de la documentación, garantizando el cumplimiento de los límites de línea, referencias cruzadas y recuentos de archivos utilizando scripts de bash y comandos grep, racionalizando el proceso de documentación para sistemas de documentación de 3 niveles","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la validation de la documentation, en garantissant la conformité avec les limites de ligne, les références croisées et les comptes de fichiers en utilisant des scripts bash et des commandes grep, rationalisant ainsi le processus de documentation pour les systèmes de documentation à 3 niveaux","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Validierung der Dokumentation zu automatisieren und so die Einhaltung von Zeilenlimits, Querverweisen und Dateizählungen unter Verwendung von bash-Skripten und grep-Befehlen sicherzustellen, wodurch der Dokumentationsprozess für 3-Ebenen-Dokumentationssysteme rationalisiert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a validação de documentação, garantindo o cumprimento dos limites de linhas, referências cruzadas e contagem de arquivos usando scripts bash e comandos grep, simplificando o processo de documentação para sistemas de documentação de 3 camadas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать проверку документации, обеспечивая соблюдение ограничений строк, перекрестных ссылок и количества файлов с помощью скриптов bash и команд grep, оптимизируя процесс документации для 3-уровневых систем документации","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على توفير التحقق التلقائي من توثيق وضمان الامتثال لحدود الأسطر والمراجع المتقاطعة وعد الملفات باستخدام سكربتات bash وأوامر grep ، وتبسيط عملية توثيق لنظام توثيق 3 طبقات"},"useCases":{"en":["Validating documentation compliance after closing plans","Automating cross-reference checks in markdown files","Verifying file counts before committing documentation changes"],"zh":["关闭计划后验证文档合规性","在markdown文件中自动化交叉引用检查","提交文档更改前验证文件数量"],"ja":["プランを閉じた後ドキュメントのコンプライアンスを検証する","マークダウンファイル内のクロスリファレンスを自動化する","ドキュメントの変更をコミットする前にファイル数を検証する"],"ko":["계획을 닫은 후 문서의 준수 확인","마크다운 파일에서 교차 참조检查 자동화","문서 변경 사항을 커밋하기 전에 파일 수 확인"],"es":["Validar el cumplimiento de la documentación después de cerrar planes","Automatizar las comprobaciones de referencias cruzadas en archivos markdown","Verificar los recuentos de archivos antes de confirmar los cambios en la documentación"],"fr":["Valider la conformité de la documentation après la clôture des plans","Automatiser les vérifications de références croisées dans les fichiers markdown","Vérifier les comptes de fichiers avant de confirmer les modifications de la documentation"],"de":["Überprüfen des Dokumentationskonformitätsnach der Schließung von Plänen","Automatisieren von Querverweisprüfungen in Markdown-Dateien","Überprüfen der Dateizählungen vor dem Bestätigen von Änderungen an der Dokumentation"],"pt":["Validar conformidade de documentação após fechar planos","Automatizar verificações de referências cruzadas em arquivos markdown","Verificar contagem de arquivos antes de enviar alterações de documentação"],"ru":["Проверка соответствия документации после закрытия планов","Автоматизация проверок перекрестных ссылок в файлах markdown","Проверка количества файлов перед внесением изменений в документацию"],"ar":["التحقق من الامتثال لتوثيق بعد إغلاق الخطط","توفير التحقق التلقائي من المراجع المتقاطعة في الملفات markdown","التحقق من عدد الملفات قبل إرسال التغييرات في توثيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires bash environment","Limited to markdown file validation","Dependent on grep command for cross-reference checks"],"zh":["需要bash环境","仅限markdown文件验证","依赖grep命令进行交叉引用检查"],"ja":["bash環境が必要","マークダウンファイルの検証のみ","クロスリファレンスのチェックにはgrepコマンドに依存する"],"ko":["bash 환경이 필요","마크다운 파일만 유효성 검사","교차 참조检查을 위해 grep 명령어에 의존"],"es":["Requiere entorno de bash","Limitado a la validación de archivos markdown","Dependiente del comando grep para comprobaciones de referencias cruzadas"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement bash","Limité à la validation de fichiers markdown","Dépendant de la commande grep pour les vérifications de références croisées"],"de":["Benötigt eine bash-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Validierung von Markdown-Dateien","Abhängig vom grep-Befehl für Querverweisprüfungen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente bash","Limitado à validação de arquivos markdown","Dependente do comando grep para verificações de referências cruzadas"],"ru":["Требует среды bash","Ограничен проверкой файлов markdown","Зависит от команды grep для проверок перекрестных ссылок"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة bash","محدود إلى التحقق من صحة الملفات markdown","يعتمد على أمر grep للتحقق من المراجع المتقاطعة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"fbcaac30e65b2a7868959a90ae218da03c774998dfaf78b31189df0519c1cafd","qualityScore":48}');
