alta resolución","fr":"l-capture-all-pages est un outil de capture d''écran pour vérifier les traductions et les dispositions en haute résolution","de":"l-capture-all-pages ist ein Tool zur Erfassung von Screenshots, um Übersetzungen und Layouts in hoher Auflösung zu überprüfen","pt":"O l-capture-all-pages é uma habilidade de captura de tela que verifica a exatidão das traduções em páginas de manual","ru":"ИИ Агент l-capture-all-pages - это навык захвата экрана, который проверяет точность переводов на страницах руководства","ar":"l-capture-all-pages هي مهارة لتقاط الشاشة التي تحقق من دقة الترجمات في صفحات الدليل"},"features":{"en":["Captures screenshots of all pages at 2000x1600 resolution","Verifies translations match page images using Playwright","Checks layout correctness and detects content mismatches","Requires pnpm dev server running on port 3100","Supports global or project-level Playwright installation"],"zh":["捕获所有页面以验证翻译","验证布局和内容","支持高分辨率截图（2000x1600）","使用Playwright进行页面捕获","支持pnpm dev服务器"],"ja":["すべてのページをキャプチャして翻訳を検証","レイアウトとコンテンツを検証","高解像度のスクリーンショット（2000x1600）をサポート","Playwrightを使用したページキャプチャ","pnpm devサーバーをサポート"],"ko":["모든 페이지를 캡처하여 번역을 확인","레이아웃과 내용을 확인","고해상도 스크린샷（2000x1600）을 지원","Playwright를 사용한 페이지 캡처","pnpm dev 서버를 지원"],"es":["Captura de pantallas de alta resolución (2000x1600)","Verificación de traducciones y layouts","Compatibilidad con Playwright","Requiere servidor de desarrollo en ejecución en el puerto 3100","Uso de la línea de comandos (CLI) para la captura de pantallas"],"fr":["Capture d''écrans haute résolution (2000x1600)","Vérification des traductions et des dispositions","Compatibilité avec Playwright","Nécessite un serveur de développement en cours d''exécution sur le port 3100","Utilisation de la ligne de commande (CLI) pour la capture d''écrans"],"de":["Erfassung von Screenshots in hoher Auflösung (2000x1600)","Überprüfung von Übersetzungen und Layouts","Kompatibilität mit Playwright","Benötigt einen Entwicklungsserver, der auf Port 3100 ausgeführt wird","Verwendung der Kommandozeile (CLI) zur Erfassung von Screenshots"],"pt":["Captura de tela em alta resolução (2000x1600)","Verificação de traduções em todas as páginas do visualizador de manual","Uso de Playwright para automação","Execução em servidor de desenvolvimento na porta 3100","Captura de todas as páginas do manual para verificação"],"ru":["Захват экрана в высоком разрешении (2000x1600)","Проверка переводов на всех страницах руководства","Использование Playwright для автоматизации","Выполнение на сервере разработки на порте 3100","Захват всех страниц руководства для проверки"],"ar":["تقاط الشاشة بدرجة عالية الدقة (2000x1600)","التحقق من الترجمات في جميع صفحات معرض الدليل","استخدام Playwright للأتمتة","التشغيل على خادم التطوير على منفذ 3100","التقاط جميع صفحات الدليل للتحقق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use l-capture-all-pages","l-capture-all-pages setup guide","l-capture-all-pages alternative","l-capture-all-pages vs manual verification","l-capture-all-pages install with Playwright","l-capture-all-pages high-resolution page capture"],"zh":["AI工具","l-capture-all-pages","页面捕获","翻译验证","布局验证","Playwright","pnpm dev","高分辨率截图"],"ja":["AIエージェント","l-capture-all-pages","ページキャプチャ","翻訳検証","レイアウト検証","Playwright","pnpm dev","高解像度スクリーンショット"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","l-capture-all-pages","페이지 캡처","번역 확인","레이아웃 확인","Playwright","pnpm dev","고해상도 스크린샷"],"es":["l-capture-all-pages","herramientas de captura de pantallas","verificación de traducciones","layouts de alta resolución","Playwright","CLI","servidor de desarrollo","configuración de l-capture-all-pages"],"fr":["l-capture-all-pages","outils de capture d''écran","vérification des traductions","dispositions haute résolution","Playwright","CLI","serveur de développement","configuration de l-capture-all-pages"],"de":["l-capture-all-pages","Tools zur Erfassung von Screenshots","Überprüfung von Übersetzungen","Layouts in hoher Auflösung","Playwright","CLI","Entwicklungsserver","Konfiguration von l-capture-all-pages"],"pt":["l-capture-all-pages","captura de tela","verificação de traduções","Playwright","servidor de desenvolvimento","alta resolução","visualizador de manual","configuração do l-capture-all-pages"],"ru":["ИИ Агент l-capture-all-pages","захват экрана","проверка переводов","Playwright","сервер разработки","высокое разрешение","руководство","настройка ИИ Агента l-capture-all-pages"],"ar":["l-capture-all-pages","تقاط الشاشة","التحقق من الترجمات","Playwright","خادم التطوير","درجة عالية الدقة","معرض الدليل","إعداد l-capture-all-pages"]}},"owner":"Takazudo","repo":"takazudomodular-manuals","repoPath":"Takazudo/takazudomodular-manuals","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.316Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"l-capture-all-pages","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Capture All Pages\n\nCapture all pages of the manual viewer at high resolution (2000x1600) for visual verification of translations.\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill captures screenshots of all pages in the manual viewer to verify that:\n\n- Translations match the page images\n- Layout is correct\n- No content mismatches or missing translations\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n\n- Dev server running on port 3100 (`pnpm dev`)\n- Playwright installed globally or in project\n\n**Usage:**\n\n```bash\n# Capture all pa","body":"# Capture All Pages\n\nCapture all pages of the manual viewer at high resolution (2000x1600) for visual verification of translations.\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill captures screenshots of all pages in the manual viewer to verify that:\n\n- Translations match the page images\n- Layout is correct\n- No content mismatches or missing translations\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n\n- Dev server running on port 3100 (`pnpm dev`)\n- Playwright installed globally or in project\n\n**Usage:**\n\n```bash\n# Capture all pages (default: 30 pages)\nnode .claude/skills/capture-all-pages/scripts/capture.js\n\n# Capture specific number of pages\nnode .claude/skills/capture-all-pages/scripts/capture.js --pages 280\n\n# Custom base URL\nnode .claude/skills/capture-all-pages/scripts/capture.js --base-url http://zmanuals.localhost:3100/manuals/oxi-one-mk2/page\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nThe capture script supports these options:\n\n- `--pages <number>` - Total pages to capture (default: 30)\n- `--base-url <url>` - Base URL for pages (default: http://zmanuals.localhost:3100/manuals/oxi-one-mk2/page)\n- `--output-dir <path>` - Custom output directory (default: __inbox/captures-{timestamp})\n\n**Default settings:**\n\n- Viewport: 2000x1600 (high resolution for detail)\n- Output: `__inbox/captures-{YYYYMMDD}-{HHMMSS}/`\n- Format: PNG files named `page-001.png` to `page-NNN.png`\n- Timeout: 15 seconds per page\n- Wait after load: 2 seconds\n\n## Execution Workflow\n\n1. **Verify dev server is running**\n\n   ```bash\n   curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" http://zmanuals.localhost:3100/manuals/oxi-one-mk2/page/1\n   # Should return 200\n   ```\n\n2. **Run capture script**\n\n   ```bash\n   node .claude/skills/capture-all-pages/scripts/capture.js\n   ```\n\n   The script will:\n\n   - Create timestamped output directory\n   - Launch headless browser\n   - Capture each page sequentially\n   - Report progress and errors\n   - Save summary.json with results\n\n3. **Check results**\n\n   ```bash\n   ls -lh __inbox/captures-*/page-*.png\n   ```\n\n## Output Structure\n\n```\n__inbox/captures-20260103-163245/\n├── page-001.png (2000x1600)\n├── page-002.png (2000x1600)\n├── page-003.png (2000x1600)\n...\n├── page-030.png (2000x1600)\n└── summary.json (capture results)\n```\n\n**summary.json contains:**\n\n- Timestamp and configuration\n- Success/failure counts\n- Error details for failed captures\n\n## Notes\n\n- All screenshots saved to project''s `__inbox/` directory (gitignored)\n- Session timestamp prevents overwriting previous captures\n- Script uses headless Chromium (no visible browser window)\n- Failed page captures are logged but don''t stop the script\n- High resolution (2000x1600) allows detailed inspection of translations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:49.369Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Translation Verification Agents needing comprehensive content analysis and visual verification capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要全面内容分析和视觉验证功能的翻译验证代理。","ja":"翻訳検証エージェントが包括的なコンテンツ分析と視覚的検証機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석 및 시각적 확인 기능이 필요한 번역 확인 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Verificación de Traducción que necesitan un análisis de contenido integral y capacidades de verificación visual.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Vérification de Traduction nécessitant une analyse de contenu complète et des capacités de vérification visuelle.","de":"Perfekt für Übersetzungsverifizierungsagenten, die eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse und visuelle Überprüfungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Verificação de Tradução que necessitam de análise de conteúdo abrangente e capacidades de verificação visual.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Проверки Перевода, которым необходима комплексный анализ контента и возможности визуальной проверки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء verificar الترجمة الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل محتوى شاملا وقدرات التحقق المرئي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture high-resolution screenshots of all pages in the manual viewer for translation verification, ensuring correct layouts and no content mismatches using Playwright and high-resolution imaging (2000x1600).","zh":"通过Playwright和高分辨率成像（2000x1600）使代理能够捕获手册查看器中所有页面的高分辨率屏幕截图，从而确保正确的布局和无内容不匹配。","ja":"Playwrightと高解像度イメージング（2000x1600）を使用して、エージェントがマニュアルビューアー内のすべてのページの高解像度スクリーンショットをキャプチャできるようにし、正しいレイアウトとコンテンツの不一致がなくなることを保証します。","ko":"Playwright와 고해상도 이미징(2000x1600)을 사용하여 에이전트가 수동 뷰어 내의 모든 페이지의 고해상도 스크린샷을 캡처할 수 있도록 하여, 올바른 레이아웃과 콘텐츠 불일치가 없음을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a capturar capturas de pantalla de alta resolución de todas las páginas en el visor de manual para la verificación de traducciones, asegurando diseños correctos y sin discrepancias de contenido utilizando Playwright y imágenes de alta resolución (2000x1600).","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer des captures d''écran haute résolution de toutes les pages du visualiseur de manuel pour la vérification de traduction, garantissant des dispositions correctes et aucune erreur de contenu en utilisant Playwright et l''imagerie haute résolution (2000x1600).","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, hochauflösende Screenshots aller Seiten im Handbuch-Viewer für die Übersetzungsverifizierung zu erfassen, um korrekte Layouts und keine Inhaltsfehler sicherzustellen, indem Playwright und hochauflösende Bilder (2000x1600) verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar telas de alta resolução de todas as páginas no visualizador de manual para verificação de tradução, garantindo layouts corretos e sem discrepâncias de conteúdo usando Playwright e imagem de alta resolução (2000x1600).","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватить высококачественные скриншоты всех страниц в просмотрщике руководства для проверки перевода, гарантируя правильные макеты и отсутствие несоответствий содержания с помощью Playwright и высококачественного изображения (2000x1600).","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التقاط لقطات شاشة عالية الدقة من جميع الصفحات في معاينة الدليل للتحقق من الترجمة ، وضمان تخطيطات صحيحة وعدم وجود اختلافات في المحتوى باستخدام Playwright والتصوير عالي الدقة (2000x1600)."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating translation verification for manual viewers","Generating visual reports for layout and content validation","Debugging content mismatches and missing translations in manual viewers"],"zh":["为手册查看器自动化翻译验证","生成布局和内容验证的视觉报告","调试手册查看器中的内容不匹配和缺失翻译"],"ja":["マニュアルビューアーの翻訳検証を自動化する","レイアウトとコンテンツの検証のための視覚的なレポートを生成する","マニュアルビューアー内のコンテンツの不一致と欠落した翻訳をデバッグする"],"ko":["수동 뷰어의 번역 확인을 자동화하는 것","레이아웃 및 콘텐츠 유효성 검사의 시각적 보고서 생성","수동 뷰어의 콘텐츠 불일치 및 누락 번역 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la verificación de traducciones para visores de manual","Generación de informes visuales para la validación de diseño y contenido","Depuración de discrepancias de contenido y traducciones faltantes en visores de manual"],"fr":["Automation de la vérification de traduction pour les visualiseurs de manuel","Génération de rapports visuels pour la validation de la disposition et du contenu","Débogage des erreurs de contenu et des traductions manquantes dans les visualiseurs de manuel"],"de":["Automatisierung der Übersetzungsverifizierung für Handbuch-Viewer","Erstellung von Visualberichten für die Überprüfung von Layout und Inhalt","Fehlerbehebung von Inhaltsfehlern und fehlenden Übersetzungen in Handbuch-Viewern"],"pt":["Automatizar a verificação de tradução para visualizadores de manuais","Gerar relatórios visuais para validação de layout e conteúdo","Depurar discrepâncias de conteúdo e traduções ausentes em visualizadores de manuais"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку перевода для просмотрщиков руководств","Генерировать визуальные отчеты для проверки макета и содержания","Отлаживать несоответствия содержания и пропущенные переводы в просмотрщиках руководств"],"ar":["تحسين التحقق من الترجمة للقارئين اليدويين","توليد تقارير مرئية للتحقق من تخطيط المحتوى","تصحيح أخطاء المحتوى والترجمات الناقصة في قارئي الدليل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires dev server running on port 3100","Playwright installation required globally or in project","Limited to manual viewer pages"],"zh":["需要开发服务器在端口3100上运行","需要全局或项目安装Playwright","仅限手册查看器页面"],"ja":["ポート3100で動作する開発サーバーが必要","Playwrightのグローバルまたはプロジェクトインストールが必要","マニュアルビューアーページのみに限定"],"ko":["포트 3100에서 실행되는 개발 서버가 필요함","전역 또는 프로젝트에서 Playwright 설치가 필요함","수동 뷰어 페이지에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere servidor de desarrollo en ejecución en el puerto 3100","Se requiere la instalación de Playwright de forma global o en el proyecto","Limitado a páginas del visor de manual"],"fr":["Nécessite un serveur de développement en cours d''exécution sur le port 3100","L''installation de Playwright est requise de manière globale ou dans le projet","Limité aux pages du visualiseur de manuel"],"de":["Erfordert Entwicklungsserver, der auf Port 3100 ausgeführt wird","Playwright-Installation ist global oder im Projekt erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Seiten des Handbuch-Viewers"],"pt":["Requer servidor de desenvolvimento em execução na porta 3100","Instalação do Playwright necessária globalmente ou no projeto","Limitado a páginas do visualizador de manual"],"ru":["Требуется сервер разработки, работающий на порту 3100","Требуется глобальная или проектная установка Playwright","Ограничен просмотрщиками руководства"],"ar":["يتطلب خادم التطوير التشغيلي على منفذ 3100","تثبيت Playwright مطلوب على المستوى العالمي أو في المشروع","محدود بصفحات معاينة الدليل"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"3aa7c36dd5908be3ae90858d5117843bc4dceb8726c11e10d1257b1cd3eab7e5","qualityScore":48}');
