INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('phpmac/trader/binance-futures-trading', 'binance-futures-trading', 'phpmac', 'trader', 'community', 'binance-futures-trading phpmac trader community The binance-futures-trading skill provides a comprehensive trading solution for Binance USDT-M perpetual contracts, enabling developers to automate account balance queries, position information, and order management. This skill benefits developers and traders looking to streamline their trading o... 币安 USDT 合约交易技能提供了完整的交易功能，包括账户余额查询、持仓信息查询、杠杆/保证金模式设置等，通过 MCP 工具实现 Binance Futures Trading AIエージェントは、口座残高の照会、ポジション情報の照会、レバレッジ/マージン モードの設定など、包括的な取引機能を提供します 바이낸스 선물 거래 AI 에이전트는 계좌 잔고 조회, 포지션 정보 조회, 레버리지/마진 모드 설정 등 완전한 거래 기능을 제공합니다 El skill de trading de futuros en Binance ofrece funcionalidades de trading completas para USDT-M, incluyendo consulta de cuenta y gestión de órdenes Le skill de trading de futures sur Binance propose des fonctionnalités de trading complètes pour USDT-M, notamment la consultation de compte et la gestion d''ordres Der Binance-Futures-Trading-Skill bietet umfassende Trading-Funktionen für USDT-M, einschließlich Kontostandsabfragen und Ordermanagement A habilidade de negociação de futuros da Binance fornece funcionalidades de trading completo para contratos USDT-M, incluindo consultas de saldo e posição, configuração de alavancagem e garantia, e gerenciamento de ordens. Навык торговли фьючерсами Binance предоставляет полный функционал для торговли контрактами USDT-M, включая запросы баланса и позиции, настройку кредитного плеча и гарантий, а также управление ордерами. توفّر مهارة تداول العقود الآجلة لبياننس وظائف تداول كاملة ل العقود USDT-M ، بما في ذلك استفسارات الرصيد والمركز ، وإعداد الرافعة المالية والضمان ، وإدارة الطلبات. how to use binance-futures-trading binance-futures-trading setup guide automated USDT-M contract trading binance-futures-trading vs manual trading install binance-futures-trading skill binance-futures-trading API documentation what is binance-futures-trading binance-futures-trading alternative solutions binance-futures-trading tutorial for developers 币安 USDT 合约交易 MCP 工具 自动化交易 账户余额查询 持仓信息查询 杠杆/保证金模式设置 AI 交易技能 Account balance queries using BINANCE_API_KEY and BINANCE_API_SECRET Position information queries and leverage/margin mode setting Automated opening and closing of positions with stop-loss and take-profit settings Order management capabilities, including query and cancellation of orders Support for simulated trading mode (TRADING_SIMULATION) and testnet (BINANCE_USE_TESTNET) Environment configuration using bash variables for API keys and simulation mode binance-futures-trading is a skill that offers automated trading functionality for Binance USDT-M perpetual contracts, supporting features like account balance queries and order management via the MCP tool.');
