DELETE FROM skills_fts WHERE id = 'ROBOTIS-GIT/zenoh_ros2_sdk/create-example';
INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('ROBOTIS-GIT/zenoh_ros2_sdk/create-example', 'create-example', 'ROBOTIS-GIT', 'zenoh_ros2_sdk', 'community', 'create-example ROBOTIS-GIT zenoh_ros2_sdk community The create-example skill enables developers to create new publish/subscribe examples for the zenoh-ros2-sdk, facilitating ROS 2 communication without a ROS2 environment. It benefits developers working with ROS 2 messages. 本技能指导您创建新的发布/订阅示例，用于Zenoh的ROS 2通信Python SDK。创建publisher/subscriber用于新的ROS2消息类型 このスキルでは、ZenohのROS 2通信Python SDK用の新しいパブリッシュ/サブスクライブ例を作成します。新しいROS2メッセージタイプのpublisher/subscriberを作成します 이 스킬은 Zenoh의 ROS 2 통신 Python SDK용 새로운 발행/구독 예제를 생성합니다. 새로운 ROS2 메시지 유형의 발행자/구독자를 생성합니다 El skill create-example permite crear ejemplos de publicación y suscripción para Zenoh-ROS2-SDK. Utiliza Python para la comunicación ROS 2 vía Zenoh. Le skill create-example permet de créer des exemples de publication et d''abonnement pour Zenoh-ROS2-SDK. Il utilise Python pour la communication ROS 2 via Zenoh. Das Skill create-example ermöglicht die Erstellung von Beispielen für die Veröffentlichung und das Abonnieren für Zenoh-ROS2-SDK. Es verwendet Python für die ROS 2-Kommunikation via Zenoh. O Create-Example é uma habilidade que guia você na criação de novos exemplos de publicação/assinatura para o zenoh-ros2-sdk, permitindo o uso de ROS 2 sem ambiente ROS2. Create-Example - это навык, который помогает создавать новые примеры публикации/подписки для zenoh-ros2-sdk, позволяя использовать ROS 2 без среды ROS2 для ИИ Агентов. Create-Example هو مهارة تساعدك في إنشاء أمثلة جديدة لنشر/الاستماع لصالح zenoh-ros2-sdk، مما يسمح باستخدام ROS 2 بدون بيئة ROS2 لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي. how to use create-example create-example alternative create-example install what is create-example create-example vs ros2 create-example setup guide ros 2 communication tutorial zenoh-ros2-sdk examples ROS 2 Zenoh Python SDK 创建示例 发布/订阅 ROS2消息类型 trajectory sensor geometry Generates publish/subscribe examples for the zenoh-ros2-sdk Supports creation of publishers and subscribers for new ROS2 messages Enables adding support for trajectory, sensor, geometry, and other message types Organizes examples in a structured project format within the `examples/` directory Differentiates between publishers and subscribers using odd and even numbered filenames create-example is a Python SDK for ROS 2 communication via Zenoh, allowing users to add new examples for message types and create publishers/subscribers.');
