petiscore","benutzerdefinierte icons","svg für competiscore","icon-generator-tool","hochwertige icons","professionelle icon-design"],"pt":["gerador de ícones SVG","ícones SVG personalizados","Competiscore","aplicativo de pontuação","desenvolvimento de ícones","ferramentas de design gráfico","SVG","ícones","design de ícones"],"ru":["генератор иконок SVG","пользовательские иконки SVG","Competiscore","приложение для подсчета очков","разработка иконок","инструменты графического дизайна","SVG","иконки","дизайн иконок","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["أداة生成 الأيقونات SVG","أيقونات SVG مخصصة","Competiscore","برنامج تسجيل النقاط","تصميم الأيقونات","أدوات تصميم الرسومات","SVG","الأيقونات","تصميم الأيقونات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"paul-macfarlane","repo":"competiscore-web","repoPath":"paul-macfarlane/competiscore-web","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.352Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"generate-icons","description":"Generate SVG icons for the competiscore app. Use when creating or updating avatar, team, game type, or tournament icons. Produces light/dark mode friendly SVGs with consistent sizing.","bodyPreview":"# SVG Icon Generator for Competiscore\n\nYou are an expert SVG designer creating icons for the Competiscore competitive scoring app. Generate high-quality, hand-crafted SVG icons that are visually distinct and professional.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `$0` - Icon type: `avatar`, `team`, `game-type`, `tournament`, or `all`\n- `$1` - (Optional) Specific icon name to generate, or `all` to generate the full set\n\nIf no arguments, ask the user what type and name they want.\n\n## Output Locations\n\n| Type       | Direc","body":"# SVG Icon Generator for Competiscore\n\nYou are an expert SVG designer creating icons for the Competiscore competitive scoring app. Generate high-quality, hand-crafted SVG icons that are visually distinct and professional.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `$0` - Icon type: `avatar`, `team`, `game-type`, `tournament`, or `all`\n- `$1` - (Optional) Specific icon name to generate, or `all` to generate the full set\n\nIf no arguments, ask the user what type and name they want.\n\n## Output Locations\n\n| Type       | Directory                  | Count    |\n| ---------- | -------------------------- | -------- |\n| avatar     | `public/avatars/`          | 20 icons |\n| team       | `public/team-avatars/`     | 20 icons |\n| game-type  | `public/game-type-icons/`  | 20 icons |\n| tournament | `public/tournament-icons/` | 5 icons  |\n\n## SVG Technical Requirements\n\nAll icons MUST follow these exact specifications:\n\n```xml\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n  <!-- content here -->\n</svg>\n```\n\n- **ViewBox**: Always `0 0 100 100` (square)\n- **No width/height attributes** - let the container control sizing\n- **No external dependencies** - no fonts, no linked images, no CSS classes\n- **Inline styles only** if needed, but prefer attributes\n- **Keep SVG compact** - single line or minimal lines, no unnecessary whitespace\n- **No `id` attributes** - avoid conflicts when multiple icons on same page\n\n## Light/Dark Mode Compatibility\n\nThis is CRITICAL. Icons must be visible on both light (`#ffffff`) and dark (`#1a1a2e`) backgrounds.\n\n### Rules:\n\n1. **NEVER use pure white (`#ffffff`) or pure black (`#000000`)** as primary fill colors\n2. **Use medium-tone colors** that contrast well against both backgrounds:\n   - Blues: `#3b82f6`, `#2563eb`, `#60a5fa`\n   - Greens: `#22c55e`, `#16a34a`, `#4ade80`\n   - Reds: `#ef4444`, `#dc2626`, `#f87171`\n   - Purples: `#a855f7`, `#8b5cf6`, `#c084fc`\n   - Oranges: `#f97316`, `#ea580c`, `#fb923c`\n   - Yellows: `#eab308`, `#ca8a04`, `#facc15`\n   - Pinks: `#ec4899`, `#db2777`, `#f472b6`\n   - Teals: `#14b8a6`, `#0d9488`, `#2dd4bf`\n   - Slate/Gray (for accents only): `#64748b`, `#94a3b8`, `#475569`\n3. **Use strokes for definition** when shapes might blend with background:\n   - Add `stroke` with a slightly darker/lighter shade\n   - Use `stroke-width=\"2\"` for outlines\n4. **Test mentally**: Would this icon be visible on both white and near-black backgrounds?\n\n## Visual Style by Type\n\n### Avatars (`public/avatars/`)\n\n**Style**: Cartoonish, fun character faces/figures. Think emoji-meets-game-character.\n\n- Round or rounded shapes\n- Expressive, personality-driven designs\n- Each should feel like a unique character identity\n- Use vibrant, saturated colors\n- Examples of good avatar subjects: ninja, astronaut, pirate, wizard, viking, cat, fox, panda, owl, alien, dragon, unicorn, penguin, bear, wolf\n\n### Team Icons (`public/team-avatars/`)\n\n**Style**: Bold emblems/crests/badges. Think sports team logos.\n\n- Shield, crest, or badge shapes as containers\n- Strong, bold geometric designs inside\n- Symmetric and balanced compositions\n- Use 2-3 colors max per icon for logo clarity\n- Examples of good team subjects: phoenix, wolf-pack, thunder, flame, viper, titan, hawk, kraken, lion, stag\n\n### Game Type Icons (`public/game-type-icons/`)\n\n**Style**: Clean activity/game iconography. Think app icons for specific games.\n\n- Represent the game/activity clearly\n- Clean lines, recognizable silhouettes\n- Minimal detail - should read at small sizes (24px)\n- Use 1-2 colors, with optional accent color\n- Examples: ping-pong, pool, chess, darts, bowling, cards, dice, foosball, basketball, soccer\n\n### Tournament Icons (`public/tournament-icons/`)\n\n**Style**: Competition/bracket themed. Think championship imagery.\n\n- Bracket shapes, podiums, championship themes\n- Should convey \"organized competition\"\n- Bold and authoritative designs\n- Use gold/silver/bronze accent colors for prestige\n- Examples: bracket, champion, podium, versus, grand-prix\n\n## Naming Convention\n\n- Lowercase, hyphenated: `chess-knight.svg`, `ping-pong.svg`\n- Descriptive of the icon content, not abstract\n- No numbers or prefixes\n\n## Icon Name Lists\n\nWhen generating the full set for a type, use these EXACT names:\n\n### Avatars (20)\n\nninja, astronaut, pirate, wizard, viking, cat, fox, panda, owl, alien, dragon, unicorn, penguin, bear, wolf, monkey, robot, ghost, knight, chef\n\n### Teams (20)\n\nphoenix, thunder, flame, viper, titan, hawk, kraken, lion, stag, wolf-pack, cobra, trident, spartan, avalanche, dragon, fortress, raptor, sentinel, storm, crown\n\n### Game Types (20)\n\nping-pong, pool, chess, darts, bowling, cards, dice, foosball, basketball, soccer, tennis, hockey, golf, archery, boxing, racing, trivia, poker, volleyball, badminton\n\n### Tournaments (5)\n\nbracket, champion, podium, versus, grand-prix\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\nBefore writing each SVG, verify:\n\n- [ ] ViewBox is `0 0 100 100`\n- [ ] No width/height attributes on root `<svg>`\n- [ ] Colors work on both light and dark backgrounds\n- [ ] No pure white or pure black fills\n- [ ] Icon is recognizable at 32x32px display size\n- [ ] SVG is valid and well-formed\n- [ ] Filename matches the naming convention\n- [ ] Design matches the type''s visual style\n\n## After Generating Icons\n\nAfter generating icons, remind the user to update:\n\n1. `src/lib/shared/constants.ts` - Update the icon name arrays and ICON_PATHS\n2. Validators in `src/validators/` if icon name validation exists\n3. Any forms that use icon selectors\n\n## Example SVG (for reference style)\n\nA good avatar (ninja):\n\n```xml\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"45\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"35\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#334155\"/><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"42\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\"/><circle cx=\"62\" cy=\"42\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\"/><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"42\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><circle cx=\"62\" cy=\"42\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><path d=\"M20 42 L5 35\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M80 42 L95 35\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"35\" y=\"75\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/></svg>\n```\n\nA good game type icon (chess):\n\n```xml\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\"><path d=\"M35 90 L65 90 L60 75 L40 75 Z\" fill=\"#475569\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M40 75 L60 75 L58 55 L42 55 Z\" fill=\"#64748b\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M42 55 L58 55 L60 45 L55 35 L60 25 L55 15 L45 15 L40 25 L45 35 L40 45 Z\" fill=\"#64748b\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#64748b\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:53.160Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design-focused AI Agents needing high-quality SVG icon generation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高质量SVG图标生成功能的设计为主的AI代理。","ja":"設計に重点を置いたAIエージェントが、高品質のSVGアイコン生成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고품질 SVG 아이콘 생성 기능이 필요한 디자인 중심의 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA enfocados en diseño que necesitan capacidades de generación de iconos SVG de alta calidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA axés sur la conception nécessitant des capacités de génération d''icônes SVG de haute qualité.","de":"Perfekt für designorientierte KI-Agents, die hochwertige SVG-Icon-Generierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em Design que necessitam de capacidades de geração de ícones SVG de alta qualidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для дизайн-ориентированных агентов ИИ, которым необходимы возможности генерации высококачественных иконок SVG.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل إیی التى تركز على التصمیم والتى تحتاج إلى إمكانیات جیدة لجénération الأيقونات SVG."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality, hand-crafted SVG icons for various applications, including avatar, team, game-type, tournament, and more, utilizing specific icon types and names to create visually distinct and professional icons.","zh":"赋予代理生成各种应用程序的高质量、手工制作的SVG图标，包括头像、团队、游戏类型、锦标赛等，利用特定的图标类型和名称创建视觉上不同的专业图标。","ja":"エージェントが、特定のアイコンの種類と名前を使用して、視覚的に異なるプロフェッショナルなアイコンを作成できるように、avatar、team、game-type、tournamentなどの様々なアプリケーションのための、高品質の手作りのSVGアイコンを生成します。","ko":"에이전트가 특정 아이콘 유형과 이름을 사용하여 다양한 응용 프로그램(아바타, 팀, 게임 유형, 토너먼트 등)에 대한 고품질의 수제 SVG 아이콘을 생성하여 시각적으로 다른 전문 아이콘을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar icônes SVG de alta calidad y personalizadas para diversas aplicaciones, incluyendo avatar, equipo, tipo de juego, torneo y más, utilizando tipos y nombres de iconos específicos para crear iconos visualmente distintos y profesionales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des icônes SVG de haute qualité et personnalisées pour diverses applications, notamment les avatars, les équipes, les types de jeux, les tournois et plus encore, en utilisant des types et des noms d''icônes spécifiques pour créer des icônes visuellement distinctes et professionnelles.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, hochwertige, maßgeschneiderte SVG-Icons für verschiedene Anwendungen zu generieren, einschließlich Avatar, Team, Spieltyp, Turnier und mehr, unter Verwendung spezifischer Icon-Typen und -Namen, um visuell unterschiedliche und professionelle Icons zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar ícones SVG de alta qualidade e personalizados para várias aplicações, incluindo avatar, equipe, tipo de jogo, torneio e muito mais, utilizando tipos e nomes de ícones específicos para criar ícones visualmente distintos e profissionais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать высококачественные, 手工制作 иконки SVG для различных приложений, включая аватар, команду, тип игры, турнир и многое другое, используя конкретные типы и названия иконок для создания визуально отличительных и профессиональных иконок.","ar":"یمكن للعمیلات إنتاج أيقونات SVG معدة يدیًا وذات جودة عالیة لمختلف التطبيقات، بما فیها الأواتار والفرق ونوع اللعبة والبطولة وأكثر، باستخدام أنواع وأسماء أيقونات محددة لإنشاء أيقونات متمیزة ومحترفة من الناحیة البصریة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating custom SVG icons for web applications","Creating visually distinct icons for competitive scoring apps like Competiscore","Automating icon generation for design systems"],"zh":["为Web应用程序生成自定义SVG图标","为Competiscore等竞争性评分应用程序创建视觉上不同的图标","为设计系统自动化图标生成"],"ja":["WebアプリケーションのためのカスタムSVGアイコンを生成する","Competiscoreなどの競争スコアアプリケーション用に視覚的に異なるアイコンを作成する","デザインシステムのためのアイコン生成を自動化する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 사용자 지정 SVG 아이콘 생성","Competiscore와 같은 경쟁 점수 애플리케이션에 대한 시각적으로 다른 아이콘 생성","디자인 시스템의 아이콘 생성 자동화"],"es":["Generación de iconos SVG personalizados para aplicaciones web","Creación de iconos visualmente distintos para aplicaciones de puntuación competitiva como Competiscore","Automatización de la generación de iconos para sistemas de diseño"],"fr":["Génération d''icônes SVG personnalisées pour les applications Web","Création d''icônes visuellement distinctes pour les applications de scoring compétitif comme Competiscore","Automatisation de la génération d''icônes pour les systèmes de conception"],"de":["Generierung von benutzerdefinierten SVG-Icons für Webanwendungen","Erstellung visuell unterschiedlicher Icons für wettbewerbsorientierte Bewertungsanwendungen wie Competiscore","Automatisierung der Icon-Generierung für Designsysteme"],"pt":["Geração de ícones SVG personalizados para aplicações web","Criação de ícones visualmente distintos para aplicativos de pontuação competitiva como o Competiscore","Automação da geração de ícones para sistemas de design"],"ru":["Генерация пользовательских иконок SVG для веб-приложений","Создание визуально отличительных иконок для конкурентных приложений подсчета очков, таких как Competiscore","Автоматизация генерации иконок для систем дизайна"],"ar":["إنشاء أيقونات SVG مخصصة للتطبيقات على الويب","إنشاء أيقونات متمیزة من الناحیة البصریة للتطبيقات التنافسیة لتحلیل النقاط مثل Competiscore","تأتیم إنتاج الأيقونات لأنظمة التصمیم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific icon type and name as input","Limited to generating SVG icons","No support for other file formats like PNG or JPEG"],"zh":["需要特定的图标类型和名称作为输入","仅限生成SVG图标","不支持PNG或JPEG等其他文件格式"],"ja":["入力として特定のアイコンの種類と名前が必要","SVGアイコンの生成のみ","PNGまたはJPEGなどの他のファイル形式はサポートされていない"],"ko":["입력으로 특정 아이콘 유형과 이름이 필요","SVG 아이콘 생성만 가능","PNG 또는 JPEG와 같은 다른 파일 형식은 지원되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere un tipo y nombre de icono específicos como entrada","Limitado a la generación de iconos SVG","No admite otros formatos de archivo como PNG o JPEG"],"fr":["Nécessite un type et un nom d''icône spécifiques comme entrée","Limité à la génération d''icônes SVG","N''admet pas d''autres formats de fichiers tels que PNG ou JPEG"],"de":["Benötigt einen bestimmten Icon-Typ und -Namen als Eingabe","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von SVG-Icons","Unterstützt keine anderen Dateiformate wie PNG oder JPEG"],"pt":["Requer tipo e nome de ícone específicos como entrada","Limitado à geração de ícones SVG","Sem suporte para outros formatos de arquivo como PNG ou JPEG"],"ru":["Требует конкретного типа и имени иконки в качестве входных данных","Ограничен генерацией иконок SVG","Не поддерживает другие форматы файлов, такие как PNG или JPEG"],"ar":["یحتاج إلى نوع واسم أيقونة محددين كمدخلات","محدود بإنشاء أيقونات SVG","لا يدعم صیغ ملفات أخرى مثل PNG أو JPEG"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5fe794813c2c142b94bf8c17b5c1b704deaea33c0ca0061b4992128ee20c264d","qualityScore":48}');
