오버라이드를 사용하여 AI 도구의 API 매개 변수를 검증하는 방법입니다","es":"El testing-api-overrides es una técnica de prueba que utiliza overrides condicionales para verificar el comportamiento de los Agentes de IA","fr":"Le testing-api-overrides est une technique de test qui utilise des overrides conditionnels pour vérifier le comportement des Outils d''IA","de":"Das testing-api-overrides ist eine Testtechnik, die bedingte Overrides verwendet, um das Verhalten von AI-Tools zu überprüfen","pt":"Teste de API com sobrescrita é uma técnica para verificar o comportamento de usuário em ToolHive e MCP servers","ru":"Тестирование API с переопределением - это техника для проверки поведения пользователя в ToolHive и серверах MCP","ar":"اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع الإغراق هو تقنية لفحص سلوك المستخدم في ToolHive وخوادم MCP"},"features":{"en":["Sets up conditional mocks that respond based on request parameters","Verifies user-facing behavior rather than internal request details","Tests actual API parameters using conditional overrides","Supports testing of MCP servers and AI agents","Allows for conditional mocking of API responses","Enables testing of user-facing behavior without inspecting internal request details"],"zh":["使用条件覆盖测试验证API参数","测试实际用户面向行为","设置条件模拟以响应不同的请求","验证AI工具的用户面向行为","使用ToolHive安装、管理和运行MCP服务器"],"ja":["条件付きオーバーライドテストを使用してAPIパラメータを検証する","実際のユーザー面向行为をテストする","条件付きモックを設定して異なるリクエストに応答する","AIエージェントのユーザー面向行为を検証する","ToolHiveを使用してMCPサーバーをインストール、管理、実行する"],"ko":["조건부 오버라이드 테스트를 사용하여 API 매개 변수를 검증합니다","실제 사용자 hướng 행동을 테스트합니다","조건부 모의를 설정하여 다른 요청에 응답합니다","AI 도구의 사용자 hướng 행동을 검증합니다","ToolHive를 사용하여 MCP 서버를 설치, 관리 및 실행합니다"],"es":["Utiliza overrides condicionales para probar APIs","Permite configurar mocks condicionales que responden basados en la solicitud","Verifica el comportamiento de los Agentes de IA de manera efectiva","No requiere la inspección de detalles de implementación","Se centra en la verificación de la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Utilise des overrides conditionnels pour tester les API","Permet de configurer des mocks conditionnels qui répondent en fonction de la requête","Vérifie le comportement des Outils d''IA de manière efficace","Nécessite pas l''inspection des détails d''implémentation","Se concentre sur la vérification de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Verwendet bedingte Overrides, um APIs zu testen","Ermöglicht die Konfiguration von bedingten Mocks, die basierend auf der Anfrage reagieren","Überprüft das Verhalten von AI-Tools effektiv","Benötigt keine Inspektion von Implementierungsdetails","Konzentriert sich auf die Überprüfung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Utiliza condicionais para responder diferentemente com base na solicitação","Testa o comportamento de usuário real em vez de detalhes de implementação","Permite a criação de mocks condicionais para responder com base na solicitação","Garante a correção dos parâmetros de API enviados em ToolHive e MCP servers","Melhora a confiabilidade dos testes de API","Reduz a complexidade dos testes de API"],"ru":["Использует условные конструкции для ответа по-разному в зависимости от запроса","Тестирует реальное поведение пользователя вместо деталей реализации","Позволяет создавать условные моки для ответа на основе запроса","Гарантирует правильность параметров API, отправляемых в ToolHive и серверах MCP","Улучшает надежность тестирования API","Снижает сложность тестирования API"],"ar":["يستخدم الشروط للاستجابة بشكل مختلف بناءً على الطلب","يفحص السلوك الفعلي للمستخدم بدلاً من تفاصيل التنفيذ","يسمح بإنشاء مоки مشروطة للاستجابة بناءً على الطلب","يضمن صحة معلمات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المرسلة في ToolHive وخوادم MCP","يحسن موثوقية اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","يقلل من تعقيد اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use testing-api-overrides","what is testing-api-overrides","testing-api-overrides alternative","testing-api-overrides vs mocking libraries","testing-api-overrides install","testing-api-overrides setup guide","conditional mocking for AI agents","API parameter testing for MCP servers","testing-api-overrides for developers"],"zh":["API覆盖测试","AI工具","条件覆盖","ToolHive","MCP服务器","API参数","用户面向行为","条件模拟","AI代理"],"ja":["APIオーバーライドテスト","AIエージェント","条件付きオーバーライド","ToolHive","MCPサーバー","APIパラメータ","ユーザー面向行为","条件付きモック","AIツール"],"ko":["API 오버라이드 테스트","AI 도구","조건부 오버라이드","ToolHive","MCP 서버","API 매개 변수","사용자 향行为","조건부 모의","AI 에이전트"],"es":["testing-api-overrides","Agentes de IA","pruebas de API","overrides condicionales","mocks condicionales","experiencia del usuario","pruebas de comportamiento"],"fr":["testing-api-overrides","Outils d''IA","tests d''API","overrides conditionnels","mocks conditionnels","expérience utilisateur","tests de comportement"],"de":["testing-api-overrides","AI-Tools","API-Tests","bedingte Overrides","bedingte Mocks","Benutzererfahrung","Verhaltens-tests"],"pt":["teste de API com sobrescrita","ToolHive","MCP servers","comportamento de usuário","parâmetros de API","testes de API","condicionais","mocks condicionais","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["тестирование API с переопределением","ToolHive","серверы MCP","поведение пользователя","параметры API","тестирование API","условные конструкции","условные моки","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع الإغراق","ToolHive","خوادم MCP","سلوك المستخدم","معلمات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","الشروط","مоки مشروطة","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"stacklok","repo":"toolhive-studio","repoPath":"stacklok/toolhive-studio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.384Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing-api-overrides","description":"Test that components send correct query parameters or request arguments. Use when testing filtering, sorting, pagination, or any read operation where request parameters matter. Use for test-scoped mock customization.","bodyPreview":"# Testing API Overrides\n\nTest that your code sends correct API parameters by using conditional overrides that respond differently based on the request. This approach tests actual user-facing behavior rather than inspecting internal request details.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n**Good tests verify what users see, not implementation details.**\n\nInstead of:\n\n1. ❌ Recording the request and checking query params\n2. ❌ Asserting on internal function calls\n\nDo this:\n\n1. ✅ Set up conditional mocks that respond based","body":"# Testing API Overrides\n\nTest that your code sends correct API parameters by using conditional overrides that respond differently based on the request. This approach tests actual user-facing behavior rather than inspecting internal request details.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n**Good tests verify what users see, not implementation details.**\n\nInstead of:\n\n1. ❌ Recording the request and checking query params\n2. ❌ Asserting on internal function calls\n\nDo this:\n\n1. ✅ Set up conditional mocks that respond based on params\n2. ✅ Verify the component renders the expected data\n\nIf the code sends wrong parameters, the mock returns wrong data, the UI shows wrong content, and the test fails. This catches real bugs.\n\n## When to Use Conditional Overrides\n\n- Testing list filtering (e.g., filter by group, status, search term)\n- Testing pagination parameters\n- Testing sort order\n- Any read operation where request parameters affect what data is returned\n\n**Note:** For mutations (create/update/delete), use `recordRequests()` instead. See the **testing-api-assertions** skill.\n\n## conditionalOverride()\n\nReturns different data based on request properties:\n\n```typescript\nimport { mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads } from ''@mocks/fixtures/workloads/get''\n\nmockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads.conditionalOverride(\n  // Predicate: when should this override apply?\n  ({ query }) => query.group === ''archive'',\n  // Transform: what data to return?\n  (data) => ({\n    ...data,\n    workloads: [], // Archive group is empty\n  })\n)\n```\n\n### Predicate Function\n\nThe predicate receives parsed request info with easy access to query params, path params, body, and headers:\n\n```typescript\n;({ query, path, body, headers }) => {\n  // Query parameters (pre-parsed)\n  query.group // ''?group=archive'' -> ''archive''\n  query.status // ''?status=running'' -> ''running''\n\n  // Path parameters (from route like /workloads/:name)\n  path.name // for /workloads/:name\n\n  // Request body (for POST/PUT/DELETE)\n  body?.name // parsed JSON body\n\n  // Headers\n  headers.get(''Authorization'')\n\n  return true // or false\n}\n```\n\n### Transform Function\n\nThe transform receives default data and returns modified data:\n\n```typescript\n;(data) => ({\n  ...data, // Spread defaults\n  workloads: data.workloads?.filter(\n    // Modify as needed\n    (w) => w.status === ''running''\n  ),\n})\n```\n\n## Example: Testing Group Filter\n\n```typescript\nimport { mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads } from ''@mocks/fixtures/workloads/get''\n\nit(''shows only workloads from the selected group'', async () => {\n  // Default mock returns workloads from multiple groups\n  // Add conditional override for ''production'' group\n  mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads.conditionalOverride(\n    ({ query }) => query.group === ''production'',\n    (data) => ({\n      ...data,\n      workloads: [\n        { name: ''prod-server-1'', group: ''production'', status: ''running'' },\n        { name: ''prod-server-2'', group: ''production'', status: ''running'' },\n      ],\n    })\n  )\n\n  render(<WorkloadsList group=\"production\" />)\n\n  // If component sends ?group=production, it gets the filtered data\n  // If component forgets the param, it gets default data with mixed groups\n  await waitFor(() => {\n    expect(screen.getByText(''prod-server-1'')).toBeVisible()\n    expect(screen.getByText(''prod-server-2'')).toBeVisible()\n  })\n\n  // These would appear if the filter param wasn''t sent correctly\n  expect(screen.queryByText(''dev-server'')).not.toBeInTheDocument()\n})\n```\n\n## Example: Testing Empty State\n\n```typescript\nit(''shows empty message when group has no workloads'', async () => {\n  mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads.conditionalOverride(\n    ({ query }) => query.group === ''empty-group'',\n    () => ({ workloads: [] })\n  )\n\n  render(<WorkloadsList group=\"empty-group\" />)\n\n  await waitFor(() => {\n    expect(screen.getByText(/no workloads found/i)).toBeVisible()\n  })\n})\n```\n\n## Multiple Conditional Overrides\n\nChain multiple overrides for different conditions:\n\n```typescript\nmockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads\n  .conditionalOverride(\n    ({ query }) => query.group === ''production'',\n    () => ({ workloads: productionWorkloads })\n  )\n  .conditionalOverride(\n    ({ query }) => query.group === ''staging'',\n    () => ({ workloads: stagingWorkloads })\n  )\n```\n\nLater overrides wrap earlier ones. If no predicate matches, the default fixture data is returned.\n\n## Simple Overrides (No Condition)\n\nFor test-scoped data changes without conditions, use `.override()`:\n\n```typescript\n// Override for entire test - no condition\nmockedGetApiV1BetaGroups.override(() => ({\n  groups: [{ name: ''only-group'', registered_clients: [] }],\n}))\n\n// Modify default data\nmockedGetApiV1BetaGroups.override((data) => ({\n  ...data,\n  groups: data.groups?.slice(0, 1),\n}))\n```\n\n## Error Responses\n\nUse `.overrideHandler()` for full control over the response:\n\n```typescript\nimport { HttpResponse } from ''msw''\n\n// Return error\nmockedGetApiV1BetaGroups.overrideHandler(() =>\n  HttpResponse.json({ error: ''Server error'' }, { status: 500 })\n)\n\n// Network failure\nmockedGetApiV1BetaGroups.overrideHandler(() => HttpResponse.error())\n```\n\n## Automatic Reset\n\nAll overrides are automatically reset before each test via `resetAllAutoAPIMocks()` in `vitest.setup.ts`. No cleanup needed.\n\n## Reusable Scenarios\n\nWhen the same response override is needed across many tests, define it as a scenario in the fixture instead of duplicating `.override()` calls.\n\n### Defining Scenarios (in fixtures)\n\n```typescript\n// In fixtures/workloads/get.ts\nexport const mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads = AutoAPIMock<...>({\n  workloads: [/* default data */],\n}).scenario(''empty'', (mock) => mock.override(() => ({ workloads: [] })))\n```\n\n### Using Scenarios (in tests)\n\n```typescript\nmockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads.activateScenario(''empty'')\n```\n\nScenario names are defined in `renderer/src/common/mocks/scenarioNames.ts`. Use existing names when possible to keep scenarios consolidated.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **testing-with-api-mocks** - Auto-generated mocks and fixture basics\n- **testing-api-assertions** - Verifying mutations with `recordRequests()` (create/update/delete only)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:05:44.958Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for API-centric Agents needing conditional override testing for accurate user-facing behavior.","zh":"非常适合需要使用条件覆盖测试来实现准确用户面向行为的API中心代理。","ja":"API中心のエージェントが条件によるオーバーライドテストを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"조건부 오버라이드 테스트를 통해 정확한 사용자 중심의 동작을 구현해야 하는 API 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en API que necesitan pruebas de anulación condicional para un comportamiento orientado al usuario preciso.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents centrés sur l''API nécessitant des tests de substitution conditionnelle pour un comportement orienté utilisateur précis.","de":"Perfekt für API-zentrierte Agenten, die bedingte Überschreibungstests für ein genaues benutzerorientiertes Verhalten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes centrados em API que necessitam de testes de substituição condicional para um comportamento de usuário preciso.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на API, которым необходимы тесты условного переопределения для точного пользовательского поведения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المركزين على واجهة برمجة التطبيقات التي تحتاج إلى اختبارات تجاوز شرطي لتصرفات مواجهة المستخدم الدقيقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to test API parameters using conditional overrides, ensuring accurate user-facing behavior by setting up conditional mocks that respond based on the request, utilizing protocols such as API calls and query parameters.","zh":"赋予代理测试API参数的能力，使用条件覆盖来确保用户面向行为的准确性，通过设置条件模拟来响应请求，利用诸如API调用和查询参数的协议。","ja":"エージェントにAPIパラメーターのテストを可能にし、条件によるオーバーライドを使用してユーザー面向の動作の正確性を確保し、API呼び出しやクエリパラメータなどのプロトコルを使用して条件付きのモックを設定します。","ko":"에이전트가 API 매개변수를 테스트할 수 있도록 하며, 조건부 오버라이드를 사용하여 사용자 중심의 동작의 정확성을 보장하고, API 호출 및 쿼리 매개변수와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 조건부 모의를 설정합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a probar parámetros de API utilizando anulaciones condicionales, lo que garantiza un comportamiento orientado al usuario preciso mediante la configuración de simulaciones condicionales que responden en función de la solicitud, utilizando protocolos como llamadas a API y parámetros de consulta.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tester des paramètres d''API en utilisant des substitutions conditionnelles, garantissant un comportement orienté utilisateur précis en configurant des simulations conditionnelles qui répondent en fonction de la demande, en utilisant des protocoles tels que des appels d''API et des paramètres de requête.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, API-Parameter mithilfe bedingter Überschreibungen zu testen, wodurch ein genaues benutzerorientiertes Verhalten durch die Einrichtung bedingter Mocks sichergestellt wird, die auf Basis der Anfrage reagieren, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie API-Aufrufen und Abfrageparametern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a testar parâmetros da API usando substituições condicionais, garantindo um comportamento de usuário preciso configurando mocks condicionais que respondem com base na solicitação, utilizando protocolos como chamadas de API e parâmetros de consulta.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью тестировать параметры API с помощью условных переопределений, гарантируя точное пользовательское поведение путем настройки условных.mocks, которые реагируют на основе запроса, используя протоколы, такие как вызовы API и параметры запроса.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من اختبار 매개 Parameters API باستخدام تجاوزات شرطية، مما يضمن سلوكًا دقيقًا للمستخدم من خلال إعداد مكائن شرطية تستجيب بناءً على الطلب، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل مكالمات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات ووسائط الاستعلام."},"useCases":{"en":["Testing API parameters with conditional overrides","Validating user-facing behavior","Debugging API request issues"],"zh":["使用条件覆盖测试API参数","验证用户面向行为","调试API请求问题"],"ja":["条件によるオーバーライドを使用したAPIパラメーターのテスト","ユーザー面向の動作の検証","APIリクエストの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["조건부 오버라이드를 사용한 API 매개변수 테스트","사용자 중심의 동작의 검증","API 요청 문제의 디버깅"],"es":["Pruebas de parámetros de API con anulaciones condicionales","Validación del comportamiento orientado al usuario","Depuración de problemas de solicitudes de API"],"fr":["Test des paramètres d''API avec des substitutions conditionnelles","Validation du comportement orienté utilisateur","Débogage des problèmes de requêtes d''API"],"de":["Testen von API-Parametern mit bedingten Überschreibungen","Validierung des benutzerorientierten Verhaltens","Fehlerbehebung bei API-Anfrageproblemen"],"pt":["Testar parâmetros da API com substituições condicionais","Validar comportamento de usuário","Depurar problemas de solicitação de API"],"ru":["Тестировать параметры API с помощью условных переопределений","Проверять пользовательское поведение","Отлаживать проблемы с запросами API"],"ar":["اختبار 매개 Parameters API باستخدام تجاوزات شرطية","التحقق من سلوك المستخدم","تصحيح أخطاء طلب واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires API access","Conditional override setup required"],"zh":["需要API访问","需要条件覆盖设置"],"ja":["APIアクセスが必要","条件によるオーバーライドの設定が必要"],"ko":["API 액세스가 필요","조건부 오버라이드 설정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a API","Configuración de anulación condicional requerida"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API","Configuration de substitution conditionnelle requise"],"de":["Benötigt API-Zugriff","Bedingte Überschreibungseinrichtung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API","Configuração de substituição condicional necessária"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к API","Необходима настройка условного переопределения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","الإعداد المسبق للتجاوز الشرطي مطلوب"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"db8ec95881acc231201437d8793f86bf9456fc5fd63c1a38f15c86c32c30fae7","qualityScore":48}');
DELETE FROM skills_fts WHERE id = 'stacklok/toolhive-studio/testing-api-overrides';
INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('stacklok/toolhive-studio/testing-api-overrides', 'testing-api-overrides', 'stacklok', 'toolhive-studio', 'community', 'testing-api-overrides stacklok toolhive-studio community The testing-api-overrides skill allows developers to test API parameters using conditional overrides, ensuring accurate user-facing behavior. This skill benefits developers working with AI agents and MCP servers. ToolHive允许您安装、管理和运行MCP服务器，并将其连接到AI代理，使用条件覆盖测试来验证API参数 ToolHiveはMCPサーバーをインストール、管理、実行し、AIエージェントに接続します。条件付きオーバーライドテストを使用してAPIパラメータを検証します ToolHive는 MCP 서버를 설치, 관리 및 실행하고 AI 에이전트에 연결합니다. 조건부 오버라이드 테스트를 사용하여 API 매개 변수를 검증합니다 El testing-api-overrides permite probar APIs con overrides condicionales para verificar el comportamiento de los Agentes de IA. Esto implica configurar mocks condicionales que responden basados en la solicitud. Le testing-api-overrides permet de tester les API avec des overrides conditionnels pour vérifier le comportement des Outils d''IA. Cela implique de configurer des mocks conditionnels qui répondent en fonction de la requête. Das testing-api-overrides ermöglicht das Testen von APIs mit bedingten Overrides, um das Verhalten von AI-Tools zu überprüfen. Dies beinhaltet die Konfiguration von bedingten Mocks, die basierend auf der Anfrage reagieren. O teste de API com sobrescrita permite verificar se o código envia parâmetros de API corretos em ToolHive e MCP servers Тестирование API с переопределением позволяет проверить, отправляет ли код правильные параметры API в ToolHive и серверах MCP اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع الإغراق يسمح بفحص ما إذا كان Код يرسل معلمات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الصحيحة في ToolHive وخوادم MCP how to use testing-api-overrides what is testing-api-overrides testing-api-overrides alternative testing-api-overrides vs mocking libraries testing-api-overrides install testing-api-overrides setup guide conditional mocking for AI agents API parameter testing for MCP servers testing-api-overrides for developers API覆盖测试 AI工具 条件覆盖 ToolHive MCP服务器 API参数 用户面向行为 条件模拟 AI代理 Sets up conditional mocks that respond based on request parameters Verifies user-facing behavior rather than internal request details Tests actual API parameters using conditional overrides Supports testing of MCP servers and AI agents Allows for conditional mocking of API responses Enables testing of user-facing behavior without inspecting internal request details testing-api-overrides is a technique for testing API parameters by using conditional overrides to respond differently based on the request.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('verekia/r3f-gamedev/reactive-polling', 'community', 'verekia', 'r3f-gamedev', 'verekia/r3f-gamedev', 'reactive-polling', 0, 0, 48, '2026-03-08T01:57:15.404Z', '2026-03-08T02:06:51.828Z', '6cfd58cdd5e514369d4d3c08c5d2a50ca0c37bfd06b98151b865209654a9499d', '{"id":"verekia/r3f-gamedev/reactive-polling","name":"reactive-polling","description":{"en":"Reactive polling is a technique that polls for changes to any value and triggers React re-renders when it changes, benefiting React Three Fiber game developers. It uses the useReactive hook to periodically check a selector function.","zh":"Reactive Polling允许您监测任何值的变化，并触发React重新渲染","ja":"Reactive Pollingは、任意の値の変更を監視し、Reactの再レンダリングをトリガーする","ko":"Reactive Polling은任意의 값을 감시하고React의 재렌더링을 트리거하는 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Reactive-polling es una técnica para detectar cambios en valores y disparar re-renders en React. Utiliza el hook useReactive para verificar cambios y actualizar el estado de React.","fr":"Reactive-polling est une technique pour détecter les changements de valeurs et déclencher des re-renders dans React. Elle utilise le hook useReactive pour vérifier les changements et mettre à jour l''état de React.","de":"Reactive-Polling ist eine Technik zum Erkennen von Änderungen in Werten und Auslösen von Re-Renderings in React. Sie verwendet den Hook useReactive, um Änderungen zu überprüfen und den React-Zustand zu aktualisieren.","pt":"O polling reativo é uma técnica que permite detectar mudanças em valores e disparar re-renders em React. Aprenda a implementá-lo com React Three Fiber","ru":"Реактивный опрос - это техника, которая позволяет обнаруживать изменения значений и запускать повторную отрисовку в React. Узнайте, как реализовать ее с помощью React Three Fiber и ИИ Агентов","ar":"الاستطلاع التفاعلي هو تقنية تسمح بالكشف عن التغييرات في القيم وتشغيل إعادة العرض في React. تعرف على كيفية تنفيذه مع React Three Fiber ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"Reactive Polling: Trigger React Re-renders with useReacti...","zh":"Reactive Polling Setup Guide - AIエージェント工具","ja":"Reactive Polling ベストプラクティス - AIエージェント","ko":"Reactive Polling 구현 방법 - AI 에이전트 도구","es":"Guía de configuración de reactive-polling para desarrollo...","fr":"Mise en place de reactive-polling pour le développement d...","de":"Reactive-Polling-Setup-Anleitung für React-Spielentwicklung","pt":"Guia de Configuração de Polling Reativo com React Three F...","ru":"Руководство по настройке реактивного опроса с помощью Rea...","ar":"دليل إعداد الاستطلاع التفاعلي مع React Three Fiber ووكلاء..."},"description":{"en":"Discover how to implement reactive polling in your React applications and trigger re-renders with the useReactive hook. Learn more and get started today!","zh":"了解如何使用Reactive Polling实现实时更新，提高React应用性能","ja":"Reactive Pollingを使用してリアルタイム更新を実現し、Reactアプリのパフォーマンスを向上させる","ko":"Reactive Polling을 사용하여 실시간 업데이트를 구현하고 React 애플리케이션 성능을 향상시키는 방법","es":"Aprende a implementar reactive-polling en tus proyectos de juego con React y mejora el rendimiento de tu aplicación","fr":"Découvrez comment mettre en œuvre reactive-polling dans vos projets de jeu React pour améliorer les performances de votre application","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie reactive-polling in Ihre React-Spielprojekte implementieren und die Leistung Ihrer Anwendung verbessern","pt":"Aprenda a implementar o polling reativo em seus projetos de jogos com React Three Fiber e melhore a experiência do usuário","ru":"Узнайте, как реализовать реактивный опрос в ваших игровых проектах с помощью React Three Fiber и ИИ Агентов для улучшения пользовательского опыта","ar":"تعرف على كيفية تنفيذ الاستطلاع التفاعلي في مشاريع ألعابك مع React Three Fiber ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"},"definition":{"en":"Reactive polling is a technique that uses a hook to periodically check a selector function and trigger React re-renders when the value changes.","zh":"Reactive Polling是一种监测值变化并触发React重新渲染的技术","ja":"Reactive Pollingは、値の変更を監視してReactの再レンダリングをトリガーする技術","ko":"Reactive Polling은 값의 변경을 감지하여 React의 재렌더링을 트리거하는 기술입니다","es":"Reactive-polling es una técnica de programación que utiliza un hook personalizado para detectar cambios en valores y actualizar el estado de React","fr":"Reactive-polling est une technique de programmation qui utilise un hook personnalisé pour détecter les changements de valeurs et mettre à jour l''état de React","de":"Reactive-Polling ist eine ProgrammierTechnik, die einen benutzerdefinierten Hook verwendet, um Änderungen in Werten zu erkennen und den React-Zustand zu aktualisieren","pt":"Polling reativo é uma técnica que detecta mudanças em valores e dispara re-renders em React","ru":"Реактивный опрос - это техника, которая обнаруживает изменения значений и запускает повторную отрисовку в React","ar":"الاستطلاع التفاعلي هو تقنية الكشف عن التغييرات في القيم وتشغيل إعادة العرض في React"},"features":{"en":["Creates a useReactive hook that uses useFrame to periodically check a selector function","Triggers React re-renders when the value changes","Compares with previous value to detect changes","Throttles polling with useFrame for configurable FPS","Updates React state only when value actually changes"],"zh":["使用useReactive钩子监测值变化","使用useFrame周期性检查选择器函数","比较前后值以检测变化","仅在值实际变化时更新状态","使用可配置的FPS进行节流"],"ja":["useReactiveフックを使用して値の変更を監視","useFrameを使用して選択関数を周期的にチェック","前後の値を比較して変更を検知","値が実際に変更された場合のみ状態を更新","可構成のFPSでポーリングを抑制"],"ko":["useReactive 훅을 사용하여 값의 변경을 감시","useFrame을 사용하여 선택 함수를 주기적으로 체크","이전과 이후의 값을 비교하여 변경을 감지","값이 실제로 변경된 경우에만 상태를 업데이트함","구성 가능한 FPS로 폴링을 제한"],"es":["Detección de cambios en valores con un selector personalizado","Actualización del estado de React con el hook useReactive","Limitación de la velocidad de re-renderizado con useFrame","Compatibilidad con React Three Fiber para desarrollo de juegos","Mejora del rendimiento de la aplicación con re-renderizados optimizados"],"fr":["Détection des changements de valeurs avec un sélecteur personnalisé","Mise à jour de l''état de React avec le hook useReactive","Limitation de la vitesse de re-rendering avec useFrame","Compatibilité avec React Three Fiber pour le développement de jeux","Amélioration des performances de l''application avec des re-renderings optimisés"],"de":["Erkennung von Änderungen in Werten mit einem benutzerdefinierten Selektor","Aktualisierung des React-Zustands mit dem Hook useReactive","Begrenzung der Geschwindigkeit von Re-Renderings mit useFrame","Kompatibilität mit React Three Fiber für die Spielentwicklung","Verbesserung der Leistung der Anwendung mit optimierten Re-Renderings"],"pt":["Detectar mudanças em valores com uma função seletora","Comparar com o valor anterior para detectar mudanças","Atualizar o estado do React apenas quando o valor muda","Limitar a frequência de polling com uso de useFrame","Integração com React Three Fiber para jogos"],"ru":["Обнаружение изменений значений с помощью селекторной функции","Сравнение с предыдущим значением для обнаружения изменений","Обновление состояния React только когда значение фактически изменяется","Ограничение частоты опроса с помощью useFrame","Интеграция с React Three Fiber для игр и ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["الكشف عن التغييرات في القيم مع وظيفة اختيار","المقارنة مع القيمة السابقة للكشف عن التغييرات","تحديث حالة React فقط عند تغيير القيمة","تحديد تكرار الاستطلاع باستخدام useFrame","التكامل مع React Three Fiber لألعاب ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use reactive polling","what is reactive polling","reactive polling alternative","reactive polling vs react-query","reactive polling install","reactive polling setup guide","react three fiber reactive polling","useReactive hook tutorial","reactive polling best practices"],"zh":["Reactive Polling","AIエージェント工具","React性能优化","实时更新","useReactive钩子","useFrame周期性检查"],"ja":["Reactive Polling","AIエージェント","Reactパフォーマンス最適化","リアルタイム更新","useReactiveフック","useFrame周期性チェック"],"ko":["Reactive Polling","AI 에이전트 도구","React 성능 최적화","실시간 업데이트","useReactive 훅","useFrame 주기적 체크"],"es":["reactive-polling","desarrollo de juegos con React","React Three Fiber","useReactive","useFrame","detección de cambios en valores","rendimiento de aplicaciones","optimización de re-renderizados"],"fr":["reactive-polling","développement de jeux avec React","React Three Fiber","useReactive","useFrame","détection des changements de valeurs","performances des applications","optimisation des re-renderings"],"de":["reactive-polling","Spielentwicklung mit React","React Three Fiber","useReactive","useFrame","Erkennung von Änderungen in Werten","Leistung von Anwendungen","Optimierung von Re-Renderings"],"pt":["polling reativo","react three fiber","jogos","desenvolvimento de jogos","react","useFrame","estado do react","função seletora"],"ru":["реактивный опрос","react three fiber","игры","разработка игр","react","useFrame","состояние react","селекторная функция","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["الاستطلاع التفاعلي","react three fiber","ألعاب","تطوير الألعاب","react","useFrame","حالة react","وظيفة اختيار","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"verekia","repo":"r3f-gamedev","repoPath":"verekia/r3f-gamedev","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reactive-polling","description":"Poll for changes to any value and trigger React re-renders when it changes.","bodyPreview":"# Reactive Polling\n\nPoll for changes to any value and trigger React re-renders when it changes.\n\n## Technique\n\nCreate a `useReactive` hook that uses `useFrame` to periodically check a selector function. When the value changes, update React state to trigger a re-render. Throttle with a configurable FPS.\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- Selector function returns the value to watch\n- Compare with previous value to detect changes\n- Only update state when value actually changes\n- Throttle polling with `useFrame`''","body":"# Reactive Polling\n\nPoll for changes to any value and trigger React re-renders when it changes.\n\n## Technique\n\nCreate a `useReactive` hook that uses `useFrame` to periodically check a selector function. When the value changes, update React state to trigger a re-render. Throttle with a configurable FPS.\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- Selector function returns the value to watch\n- Compare with previous value to detect changes\n- Only update state when value actually changes\n- Throttle polling with `useFrame`''s `fps` option\n- Use sparingly for values that don''t change frequently\n\n## Usage\n\n```tsx\nconst useReactive = <T,>(selector: () => T, fps = 30): T => {\n  const [reactiveValue, setReactiveValue] = useState<T>(selector())\n  const previousValueRef = useRef(reactiveValue)\n\n  useFrame(\n    () => {\n      const newValue = selector()\n      if (previousValueRef.current !== newValue) {\n        previousValueRef.current = newValue\n        setReactiveValue(newValue)\n      }\n    },\n    { fps }\n  )\n\n  return reactiveValue\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst isAboveZero = useReactive(() => position.y > 0)\n```\n\n---\n\nThis skill is part of [verekia](https://x.com/verekia)''s [**r3f-gamedev**](https://github.com/verekia/r3f-gamedev).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:51.828Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for React-based AI Agents, such as Cursor or AutoGPT, needing efficient state management and re-rendering capabilities in React Three Fiber environments.","zh":"适用于基于React的AI代理，例如Cursor或AutoGPT，需要在React Three Fiber环境中高效管理状态和重新渲染功能。","ja":"ReactベースのAIエージェント、たとえばCursorまたはAutoGPT、React Three Fiber環境で効率的な状態管理と再描画機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"React 기반 AI 에이전트(예: Cursor 또는 AutoGPT)에서 React Three Fiber 환경에서 효율적인 상태 관리 및 재 렌더링 기능이 필요한 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en React, como Cursor o AutoGPT, que necesitan una gestión de estado eficiente y capacidades de volver a renderizar en entornos de React Three Fiber.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur React, tels que Cursor ou AutoGPT, nécessitant une gestion d''état efficace et des capacités de re-rendering dans les environnements React Three Fiber.","de":"Ideal für React-basierte KI-Agents, wie Cursor oder AutoGPT, die eine effiziente Zustandsverwaltung und Re-Rendering-Fähigkeiten in React Three Fiber-Umgebungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados em React, como Cursor ou AutoGPT, que necessitam de gerenciamento de estado eficiente e capacidades de re-renderização em ambientes React Three Fiber.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на базе React, таких как Cursor или AutoGPT, требующих эффективного управления состоянием и возможностей повторного рендеринга в средах React Three Fiber.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يعتمدون على React، مثل Cursor أو AutoGPT، الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة حالة فعالة وقدرات إعادة العرض في بيئات React Three Fiber."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trigger React re-renders when values change, utilizing the useReactive hook and useFrame for periodic checks, while throttling with configurable FPS to optimize performance in applications using React and selector functions.","zh":"赋予代理在值更改时触发React重新渲染的能力，利用useReactive钩子和useFrame进行周期性检查，同时使用可配置的FPS进行节流以优化使用React和选择器函数的应用程序的性能。","ja":"値の変更時にReactの再描画をトリガーするエージェントの能力を提供し、useReactiveフックとuseFrameを使用して周期的なチェックを行い、Reactとセレクタ関数を使用するアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化するために、設定可能なFPSで絞り込みます。","ko":"값이 변경될 때 React의 재 렌더링을 트리거하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, useReactive hooks와 useFrame를 사용하여 주기적인 확인을 수행하고, React 및 선택기 함수를 사용하는 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하기 위해 구성 가능한 FPS로 제한합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes desencadenar re-renderizaciones de React cuando cambian los valores, utilizando el gancho useReactive y useFrame para comprobaciones periódicas, mientras que limita con FPS configurable para optimizar el rendimiento en aplicaciones que utilizan React y funciones de selector.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déclencher des re-renderings React lorsque les valeurs changent, en utilisant l''hook useReactive et useFrame pour des vérifications périodiques, tout en limitant avec des FPS configurables pour optimiser les performances dans les applications utilisant React et des fonctions de sélecteur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, React-Neuzeichnungen auszulösen, wenn Werte ändern, indem sie den Hook useReactive und useFrame für periodische Überprüfungen verwenden, während sie mit konfigurierbaren FPS begrenzen, um die Leistung in Anwendungen mit React und Selektor-Funktionen zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a disparar re-renderizações do React quando os valores mudam, utilizando o hook useReactive e useFrame para verificações periódicas, enquanto regula com FPS configurável para otimizar o desempenho em aplicações que usam React e funções seletoras.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать повторное рендеринг React при изменении значений, используя хук useReactive и useFrame для периодических проверок, а также контролирует количество кадров в секунду для оптимизации производительности в приложениях, использующих React и функции-селекторы.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تشغيل إعادة العرض React عند تغير القيم، باستخدام حلقات useReactive و useFrame للفحوصات الدورية، مع التحكم في الإطار المتوافق لتحسين الأداء في التطبيقات التي تستخدم React ووظائف المحدد."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating React state updates based on changing values","Optimizing React Three Fiber game development with efficient re-renders","Debugging state-related issues using the useReactive hook"],"zh":["基于更改的值自动执行React状态更新","使用高效的重新渲染来优化React Three Fiber游戏开发","使用useReactive钩子调试与状态相关的问题"],"ja":["変更された値に基づいてReact状態の自動更新","効率的な再描画を使用してReact Three Fiberゲーム開発を最適化する","useReactiveフックを使用して状態関連の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["변경된 값에 따라 React 상태를 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","효율적인 재 렌더링을 사용하여 React Three Fiber 게임 개발을 최적화하는 것","useReactive hooks를 사용하여 상태와 관련된 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de estado de React en función de valores cambiantes","Optimizar el desarrollo de juegos de React Three Fiber con re-renderizaciones eficientes","Depurar problemas relacionados con el estado utilizando el gancho useReactive"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour d''état de React en fonction de valeurs changeantes","Optimiser le développement de jeux de React Three Fiber avec des re-renderings efficaces","Déboguer des problèmes liés à l''état en utilisant l''hook useReactive"],"de":["Automatisieren von React-Zustandsaktualisierungen basierend auf ändernden Werten","Optimieren der Entwicklung von React Three Fiber-Spielen mit effizienten Neuzeichnungen","Fehlerbehebung von Zustandsbezogenen Problemen mit dem Hook useReactive"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de estado do React com base em valores alterados","Otimizar o desenvolvimento de jogos React Three Fiber com re-renderizações eficientes","Depurar problemas relacionados ao estado usando o hook useReactive"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления состояния React на основе измененных значений","Оптимизировать разработку игр React Three Fiber с эффективным повторным рендерингом","Отлаживать проблемы, связанные со состоянием, используя хук useReactive"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحديثات حالة React بناءً على قيم متغيرة","تحسين تطوير ألعاب React Three Fiber مع إعادة العرض الفعالة","تصحيح الأخطاء المتعلقة بالحالة باستخدام حلقات useReactive"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and React Three Fiber setup","Dependent on the useFrame and useReactive hooks","Throttling may impact performance if not configured properly"],"zh":["需要React和React Three Fiber设置","依赖于useFrame和useReactive钩子","如果不正确配置，节流可能会影响性能"],"ja":["ReactとReact Three Fiberの設定が必要","useFrameとuseReactiveフックに依存する","適切に設定しないと、絞り込みがパフォーマンスに影響を与える可能性がある"],"ko":["React 및 React Three Fiber 설정이 필요함","useFrame 및 useReactive hooks에 의존함","적절하게 구성하지 않으면 제한이 성능에 영향을 미칠 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere configuración de React y React Three Fiber","Dependiente de los ganchos useFrame y useReactive","La limitación puede afectar el rendimiento si no se configura correctamente"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de React et de React Three Fiber","Dépendante des hooks useFrame et useReactive","La limitation peut avoir un impact sur les performances si elle n''est pas configurée correctement"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration von React und React Three Fiber","Abhängig von den Hooks useFrame und useReactive","Die Begrenzung kann die Leistung beeinträchtigen, wenn sie nicht ordnungsgemäß konfiguriert ist"],"pt":["Exige configuração do React e React Three Fiber","Dependente dos hooks useFrame e useReactive","A regulação pode impactar o desempenho se não for configurada corretamente"],"ru":["Требует настройки React и React Three Fiber","Зависит от хуков useFrame и useReactive","Регуляция может повлиять на производительность, если не настроена правильно"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد React و React Three Fiber","يعتمد على حلقات useFrame و useReactive","يمكن أن يؤثر التحكم في الأداء إذا لم يتم تهيئته بشكل صحيح"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"6cfd58cdd5e514369d4d3c08c5d2a50ca0c37bfd06b98151b865209654a9499d","qualityScore":48}');
